# Use the project's own .env, with these changes for k3s:
#  - no quotes around values (kustomize keeps them as part of the value)
#  - the LLM base URL points at the claude-headless-api Service in its namespace:
#      http://claude-api.claude-api:8000   (keep any path suffix such as /v1)
#    instead of http://host.docker.internal:<port>
